; notes = EXPERIMENTAL. One print profile from this machine's ideaMaker Hyper Speed PLA jobs. Measured: 0.20 mm layers, 0.30 mm first at 50 mm/s, 0.40 mm lines (0.48 first), walls 150, small/overhang walls 75, infill/solid/support 120, tops 100, gap 100, travel 150, Z 5, retract 1.5 at 40 / unretract 25, wipe ~0.2 mm (retract 95% first). Accel from Compensation Test.gcode: walls/infill/first 5000, solid/top 2000, travel 5000. PLA keeps extrusion_multiplier 1.00 and uses M221 S94 plus post-process first-layer FLOW 90% / top FLOW 106% (ideaMaker). Elephant foot 0.20 mm (PrusaSlicer positive inset, so holes also open ~0.20). Bridge 30 mm/s at 90% flow is not in those files (no BRIDGE type). Wipe tower stays PrusaSlicer (relative E; position is a project setting — drag it off the T1 keep-out).
